license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/egorpol/webern_op27"
abstract: >-
  An MEI 5.1 (CMN) encoding of Webern's Variations for Piano, Op. 27, after the
  Universal Edition print (plate U.E. 10881, first edition 1937), with every bar
  linked to its region on the printed page. Working edition, not yet proofread.
keywords:
  - MEI
  - music encoding
  - digital edition
  - Anton Webern
  - CAMAT
